# tests/stack-sync, as an ENTRY: evaluating this directory yields the test's
# ARG TREE, which dev/run-test then runs.
#
# A WORKER TEST: design/stack-publish.md's stack-sync operation, run through
# llm-step's real tool loop with a scripted model. It runs on std/go, which
# std/caos-test grants the mock model key, so this test's ArgTree carries the
# `secret-hash` llm-step's admission names.
curry --base:@=DEEP-DEPS/go --worker1:@=worker.go --bash-tool:@=DEEP-DEPS/bash-tool --stack-sync:@=DEEP-DEPS/stack-sync --llm-step:@=DEEP-DEPS/llm-step --stub:@=DEEP-DEPS/llm-stub --tool:@=DEEP-DEPS/llm-test-tool
